{"id":"seulement","lemma":"seulement","pos":"adv","rank":231,"glosses":["only"],"ipa":"/sœl.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/87/Fr-seulement.ogg/Fr-seulement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je veux seulement aider.","en":"I only want to help.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Comment est-ce seulement possible ?","en":"How is this even possible?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Je dis seulement la vérité.","en":"I'm only telling the truth.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"Pourquoi ceci est seulement en français?","en":"Why is this only in French?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Je voulais seulement te parler.","en":"I only wanted to talk to you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to speak, talk"}]}]}